      "name": "Mirrored Dead",
      "type": "feature",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Spent up to 3 Fear and choose the same number of PC in the scene. The Cathedral generates a corrupted echo of them through screens, speakers, drones, old photos, security footage, or AR static.</p><p>Until the end of the scene or a PC rolls with Hope, when that PC would make an action roll, the GM reveal a distorted memory, fear, regret, or false version of their past. They must choose one:</p><p>• Mark 1 Stress and become temporarily Vulnerable.<br>• Give disadvantage to the roll as the echo interferes with their senses.<br>• Mark 2 Armor Slots, as the echo “attacks” them.</p><p>What part of them did the Cathedral learn to imitate?</p>",
        "featureForm": "action",
        "actions": {}
